			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a1ba0daf-beed-5266-80f1-41fa2e03d23f")
	)
	(text "J1850 on TIM3: CH1 VPW RX, CH2 PWM RX (input capture), CH3/CH4 TX Bus+/Bus- (output compare)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "19af6154-ae26-593a-b293-a9381c7c94e9")
	)
	(text "K-line on LPUART1 (PC0 RX / PC1 TX, TXINV: the NPN inverts); 5-baud init bit-bangs PC1. ESP32 on USART2 + RTS/CTS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "25c0a6fd-ad6c-5bdb-a21b-529e39ded80c")
	)
	(text "PC3 switches DLC_SW (battery to the J1850 supply, comparators, K/L pull-ups); PB2 picks 7.24 V VPW / 4.79 V PWM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "33ddbaac-f868-50b8-bfb9-ff90e5241e02")
	)
	(text "PB4/PB6 carry UCPD dead-battery pull-downs until firmware sets PWR_CR3.UCPD_DBDIS: both are safe low at reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28e53877-955c-58bd-9adb-d1303aa3370d")
	)
	(text "DLC_SW_EN is on PC3, not PC10: the system bootloader may drive USART3 TX (PC10) and would switch DLC_SW on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 50 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9335b53c-91b9-545c-a05c-d178968d2659")
	)
	(text "Firmware turns on the internal pull-ups of PA15 (USER button) and PC0 (KLINE_RX, an open-collector output)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca9e7c7a-9f5a-5782-8f4f-aff1d67a6d39")
	)
	(text "VDDA / VREF+ are on 3V3 (100n + 1u at the pins): the ADC only reads the battery divider."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5aac9d98-b919-54d6-bc53-0963a96358e4")
	)
